      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--59a6ed#0021",
      "start": 71.88,
      "end": 74.64,
      "text": "so that action could be taken to stop cancer",
      "avg_logprob": -0.16,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.006,
      "compression_ratio": 1.67
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--59a6ed#0022",
      "start": 74.64,
      "end": 76.92,
      "text": "the moment it emerges and before it",
      "avg_logprob": -0.16,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.006,
      "compression_ratio": 1.67
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--59a6ed#0023",
      "start": 76.92,
      "end": 80.72,
      "text": "can progress beyond its infancy.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.16,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.006,
      "compression_ratio": 1.67
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--59a6ed#0024",
      "start": 80.72,
      "end": 86.56,
      "text": "The silver bullet in this case are tiny vesicles, little escape pods regularly shed by cells",
      "avg_logprob": -0.153,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004,
      "compression_ratio": 1.563
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--59a6ed#0025",
      "start": 86.56,
      "end": 89.32,
      "text": "called exosomes.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.153,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004,
      "compression_ratio": 1.563
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--59a6ed#0026",
      "start": 89.32,
      "end": 94.08,
      "text": "Exosomes are important biomarkers that provide an early warning system for the development",
      "avg_logprob": -0.153,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004,
      "compression_ratio": 1.563
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--59a6ed#0027",
      "start": 94.08,
      "end": 95.84,
      "text": "of cancer.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.153,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004,
      "compression_ratio": 1.563
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--59a6ed#0028",
      "start": 95.84,
      "end": 99.16,
      "text": "And because they are abundantly present in just about every bodily fluid, including",
      "avg_logprob": -0.153,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004,
      "compression_ratio": 1.563
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--59a6ed#0029",
      "start": 99.16,
      "end": 107.2,
      "text": "blood, urine, and saliva, they are extremely attractive for non-invasive liquid biopsies.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.153,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004,
      "compression_ratio": 1.563
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--59a6ed#0030",
      "start": 107.2,
      "end": 108.76,
      "text": "There's just one problem.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.153,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004,
      "compression_ratio": 1.563
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--59a6ed#0031",
      "start": 108.76,
      "end": 115.84,
      "text": "An automated system for rapidly sorting these important biomarkers is not currently available.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.171,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.029,
      "compression_ratio": 1.546
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--59a6ed#0032",
      "start": 115.84,
      "end": 122.46,
      "text": "We've created a technology that we call Nano-DLD that is capable of precisely this.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.171,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.029,
      "compression_ratio": 1.546
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--59a6ed#0033",
      "start": 122.46,
      "end": 128.68,
      "text": "Automated exosome isolation to aid rapid cancer diagnostics.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.171,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.029,
      "compression_ratio": 1.546
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--59a6ed#0034",
      "start": 128.68,
      "end": 133.08,
      "text": "Exosomes are the newest early warning weapon, if you will, to emerge on the liquid biopsy",
      "avg_logprob": -0.171,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.029,
      "compression_ratio": 1.546
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--59a6ed#0035",
      "start": 133.08,
      "end": 134.08,
      "text": "front.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.171,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.029,
      "compression_ratio": 1.546
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--59a6ed#0036",
      "start": 134.08,
      "end": 136.08,
      "text": "And they are really, really small.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.171,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.029,
      "compression_ratio": 1.546
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--59a6ed#0037",
      "start": 136.08,
      "end": 140.42,
      "text": "They measure just 30 to 150 nanometers in diameter.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.113,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003,
      "compression_ratio": 1.547
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--59a6ed#0038",
      "start": 140.42,
      "end": 146.0,
      "text": "This is so tiny that you could fit about a million of them into a single red blood cell.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.113,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003,
      "compression_ratio": 1.547
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--59a6ed#0039",
      "start": 146.0,
      "end": 151.2,
      "text": "That's roughly the difference between a golf ball and a fine-grained piece of sand.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.113,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003,
      "compression_ratio": 1.547
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--59a6ed#0040",
      "start": 151.2,
      "end": 156.04,
      "text": "Once thought to be little bins for unwanted cellular waste, it has been found that cells",
      "avg_logprob": -0.113,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003,
      "compression_ratio": 1.547
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--59a6ed#0041",
      "start": 156.04,
      "end": 162.14,
      "text": "actually communicate by producing and absorbing these exosomes, which contain surface",
      "avg_logprob": -0.113,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003,
      "compression_ratio": 1.547
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--59a6ed#0042",
      "start": 162.14,
      "end": 167.14,
      "text": "contraceptors, proteins, and other genetic material collected from their cell of origin.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.144,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.109,
      "compression_ratio": 1.68
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--59a6ed#0043",
      "start": 168.14,
      "end": 171.14,
      "text": "Now, when absorbed by a neighboring cell,",
      "avg_logprob": -0.144,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.109,
      "compression_ratio": 1.68
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--59a6ed#0044",
      "start": 171.14,
      "end": 174.14,
      "text": "exosomes release their contents into the receiving cell",
      "avg_logprob": -0.144,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.109,
      "compression_ratio": 1.68
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--59a6ed#0045",
      "start": 174.14,
      "end": 178.14,
      "text": "and can set in motion fundamental changes in gene expression.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.144,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.109,
      "compression_ratio": 1.68
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--59a6ed#0046",
      "start": 178.14,
      "end": 182.14,
      "text": "Some good, and this is where cancer comes in, some bad.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.144,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.109,
      "compression_ratio": 1.68
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--59a6ed#0047",
      "start": 182.14,
      "end": 186.14,
      "text": "Because they are clothed in the material of the mother cell",
      "avg_logprob": -0.144,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.109,
      "compression_ratio": 1.68
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--59a6ed#0048",
      "start": 186.14,
      "end": 188.14,
      "text": "and contain a sample of its environment,",
      "avg_logprob": -0.144,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.109,
      "compression_ratio": 1.68
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--59a6ed#0049",
      "start": 188.14,
      "end": 194.14,
      "text": "They provide a genetic snapshot of that cell's health and its origin.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.105,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.306,
      "compression_ratio": 1.621
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--59a6ed#0050",
      "start": 194.14,
      "end": 198.14,
      "text": "All of these qualities make exosomes invaluable messengers",
      "avg_logprob": -0.105,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.306,
      "compression_ratio": 1.621
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--59a6ed#0051",
      "start": 198.14,
      "end": 203.14,
      "text": "that potentially allow physicians to eavesdrop on your health at the cellular level.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.105,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.306,
      "compression_ratio": 1.621
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--59a6ed#0052",
      "start": 203.14,
      "end": 208.14,
      "text": "To catch cancer early, however, you have to frequently intercept these messages",
      "avg_logprob": -0.105,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.306,
      "compression_ratio": 1.621
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--59a6ed#0053",
      "start": 208.14,
      "end": 212.14,
      "text": "to determine when cancer-causing troublemakers within your body",
      "avg_logprob": -0.105,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.306,
      "compression_ratio": 1.621
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--59a6ed#0054",
      "start": 212.14,
      "end": 217.14,
      "text": "decide to start staging a coup, which is why regular screening is so critical.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.105,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.306,
      "compression_ratio": 1.621
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--59a6ed#0055",
      "start": 217.14,
      "end": 221.18,
      "text": "and why we're developing technologies to make this possible.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.211,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005,
      "compression_ratio": 1.58
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--59a6ed#0056",
      "start": 221.18,
      "end": 224.24,
      "text": "Now, while the first exosome-based diagnostics",
      "avg_logprob": -0.211,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005,
      "compression_ratio": 1.58
    },
    {
      "id": "joshua-smith-new-nanotech-to-catch-cancer-early--59a6ed#0057",
      "start": 224.24,
      "end": 226.9,
      "text": "emerged on the market just this year,",
      "avg_logprob": -0.211,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005,
